  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency human resources to assist with the Ebola response in Sierra Leone and Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Emergency human resources to assist with the Ebola response in Sierra Leone and Liberia is a component of Emergency support to respond to the Ebola Virus Disease in Sierra Leone 2014 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;909,678. It works in the following sector(s): Relief co-ordination and support services.</narrative>
  </description>
